WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:02.650
Last term, a voice note reached

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.490
every class group in our school.

3
00:00:05.080 --> 00:00:07.100
It said exams were cancelled.

4
00:00:07.930 --> 00:00:10.150
It sounded exactly like our head

5
00:00:10.150 --> 00:00:11.610
teacher, but it wasn't him.

6
00:00:12.790 --> 00:00:15.810
Today: how to share with care, from

7
00:00:15.810 --> 00:00:18.870
friends' photos to fakes made to fool you.

8
00:00:20.030 --> 00:00:21.190
Start with people.

9
00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:23.880
A photo of your friend is part of

10
00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:25.460
their footprint, not yours.

11
00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:28.510
So before you post it, ask.

12
00:00:29.240 --> 00:00:31.700
If they say no, that's the answer,

13
00:00:32.420 --> 00:00:34.740
and even a funny photo can hurt when

14
00:00:34.740 --> 00:00:36.100
the whole school sees it.

15
00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:40.720
Some things are never shared: private or

16
00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:42.600
embarrassing pictures of someone else,

17
00:00:43.060 --> 00:00:46.220
screenshots of a private chat, or a

18
00:00:46.220 --> 00:00:47.780
video of someone being hurt.

19
00:00:48.470 --> 00:00:50.270
Sharing them can be bullying.

20
00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:53.310
Sharing private images of anyone

21
00:00:53.310 --> 00:00:56.030
under eighteen can also be a crime,

22
00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.830
even if they sent them to you.

23
00:00:58.990 --> 00:00:59.870
Now, fakes.

24
00:01:00.650 --> 00:01:03.290
Some posts are made to fool you: an old

25
00:01:03.290 --> 00:01:06.410
photo with a new story, an edited picture,

26
00:01:06.890 --> 00:01:08.930
or a voice or video made with AI.

27
00:01:09.700 --> 00:01:12.000
They spread fast because they make

28
00:01:12.000 --> 00:01:13.300
us feel something strong.

29
00:01:14.750 --> 00:01:17.550
A strong feeling works like a fire alarm.

30
00:01:18.160 --> 00:01:20.960
When a post makes you angry, scared or

31
00:01:20.960 --> 00:01:23.620
very excited, the alarm is ringing.

32
00:01:24.290 --> 00:01:26.490
That's exactly the moment to pause,

33
00:01:27.010 --> 00:01:28.750
before your thumb taps Share.

34
00:01:30.020 --> 00:01:30.420
Quick check!

35
00:01:31.040 --> 00:01:33.560
A shocking post from an account you don't

36
00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:35.840
know says school is closed tomorrow.

37
00:01:36.420 --> 00:01:37.280
What do you do first?

38
00:01:38.630 --> 00:01:40.430
Check the school's official channel:

39
00:01:40.970 --> 00:01:43.490
its page, its group, or a teacher.

40
00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:46.230
A stranger's account can't prove itself.

41
00:01:47.590 --> 00:01:50.170
Before you share, run four checks.

42
00:01:50.930 --> 00:01:51.650
Who made it?

43
00:01:52.270 --> 00:01:54.350
Is it new, or an old story?

44
00:01:54.980 --> 00:01:57.080
Do trusted sources say the same?

45
00:01:57.700 --> 00:01:58.960
And is it trying to make

46
00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.420
me angry or scared?

47
00:02:01.850 --> 00:02:03.190
If you see someone being

48
00:02:03.190 --> 00:02:05.350
bullied online, you can help.

49
00:02:05.980 --> 00:02:08.000
Don't forward it, and don't

50
00:02:08.000 --> 00:02:09.140
add a laughing face.

51
00:02:09.860 --> 00:02:11.860
Send the person a kind message.

52
00:02:12.650 --> 00:02:14.230
Keep a screenshot of the mean

53
00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:16.910
messages, report the post, and

54
00:02:16.910 --> 00:02:18.310
tell an adult you trust.

55
00:02:19.510 --> 00:02:20.010
Your turn.

56
00:02:20.620 --> 00:02:22.880
A friend sends you a funny photo of

57
00:02:22.880 --> 00:02:24.560
a classmate asleep in class.

58
00:02:25.230 --> 00:02:26.690
Do you share it in the class group?

59
00:02:27.830 --> 00:02:30.030
Not without asking him, because

60
00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:32.070
it's his photo and his choice.

61
00:02:32.890 --> 00:02:36.270
Remember: ask before you post, never share

62
00:02:36.270 --> 00:02:38.710
private images, pause when you feel

63
00:02:38.710 --> 00:02:41.390
something strong, and check before you

64
00:02:41.390 --> 00:02:41.670
share.

65
00:02:42.900 --> 00:02:45.320
Try it tomorrow: the next time a

66
00:02:45.320 --> 00:02:47.800
shocking post reaches you, wait ten

67
00:02:47.800 --> 00:02:49.520
minutes before you share anything.

68
00:02:50.260 --> 00:02:52.220
Run the four checks, and tell a

69
00:02:52.220 --> 00:02:53.000
friend what you found.
